ng of the opposing pitchers faced by our middle-order hitters. We are prioritizing game-cap management, opting to leave bench options like **Jonathan Aranda** or **Gleyber Torres** on the pine rather than burn limited starts on sub-40 efficiency plays. The path to a successful day requires **Cal Raleigh** to capitalize on his favorable spot in the order, while we bank on **Masyn Winn** to manufacture a stolen base to keep us competitive in that category.",
